 "name_en": "Business Event Handling (1NN)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Business Event Handling (1NN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With a standardized event mechanism, you can provision the event catalog for all business objects across the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> application, to enable applications, partners, and customers to consume events related to all <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> business objects.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With event activation management, you can propagate only subscribed events to the messaging infrastructure and to those subscribers or receivers.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Side-by-side extensions provide a powerful way of extending <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> applications on <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP Business Technology Platform</span> for customers and partners without impacting the digital core, by building decoupled extension applications running side-by-side with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689__key_process_flow\"></section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Consume events based on business objects</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use front-end application to maintain subscription</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage all the active, in-active subscriptions in one place</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage event handling subscriptions effectively</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>业务事件处理 (1NN)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过标准化事件机制，您可以跨 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 应用程序为所有业务对象配置事件目录，以使应用程序、合作伙伴和客户能够使用与所有 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 业务对象相关的事件。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过事件激活管理，您可以仅将订阅的事件传播到消息传递基础架构以及这些租用者或接收方。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">并排扩展通过构建与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 并排运行的解耦扩展应用程序，为客户和合作伙伴提供在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP Business Technology Platform</span> 上扩展 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 应用程序而不会影响数字核心的强大方法。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689__key_process_flow\"></section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9c35bae8cff4128a0a3acf4ad18f689__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">基于业务对象使用事件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用前端应用程序维护订阅</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在一个位置管理所有活动、非活动订阅</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">有效管理事件处理租用</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
